  "claim_ceiling": "The January out-of-month holdout fails the predeclared full generalization rule because only 11 of 19 complete windows lie within plus-or-minus 3 dB after applying the unchanged scalar. The scalar nevertheless remains close to the January central tendency and all fixed-subband median gates pass. This weakens a December-only central-offset explanation but rejects a simple stationary one-scalar-per-window model for this January 18:00 UTC sample. No physical cause is identified and the frozen 119-Hz negative result remains unchanged."
